  "body": "Hi there,\nI’m running into an intermittent issue with dropdown menus in ART. Sometimes, when I click a dropdown, the menu appears but immediately disappears as soon as I release the mouse button, so I have to click it again to actually use it. Other times, a short click behaves as expected and the menu stays open.\n\nIt feels similar to the long-press behaviour (where the menu only stays visible while the mouse button is held down), which I assume is intentional. However, for a normal short click I’d expect the menu to remain open until I make a selection or click elsewhere.\n\nThis happens with both my mouse and the MacBook trackpad\n\nThanks!\n\n\nRyan\n\nART VERSION: 1.25.11 (although has been happening since I started using ART a few versions go).\nMAC OS: 15.6.1 \n\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9e2f55dd-d7e2-4827-964d-b9f09290084f\n",
